      "sourceTextSha256": "90e3025d91525cb7fcfcf6c9dc065c66ad64166b529456b8df8b19e364887d9c",
      "text": "The border is crossed not by land but by air — a direct flight from Puerto Natales to El Calafate, bypassing Santiago and Buenos Aires. Here nature reveals itself in its most pristine beauty, and the accommodation becomes part of the landscape.\n\nHotel: EOLO Patagonia, Corner Room.",
